TYPE=string
GROUP=test-registry
DOC=SPIRA_TEST_REGISTRY_PATH — The SQLite file the test registry keeps each test's lifecycle state in; empty means test-registry.sqlite in the run directory, which the test-registry binary resolves.
SCHEMA=The test registry file, owned by the test-registry binary alone. Put it on the disk that holds run/, apart from the control store, and include it in the off-box backup. The binary creates and initialises the file on first open.
DEFAULT<<'SPIRA_CONF_DEFAULT_EOF'
    : "${SPIRA_TEST_REGISTRY_PATH:=}"
SPIRA_CONF_DEFAULT_EOF
